  <notes type="string">Transcribe the pauses; the artist says they are the content.</notes>
  <id type="string">INT_2017_0082</id>
  <title type="string">Against what the gallery cleaner threw away</title>
  <description type="string">Bartholomew Nakamura talks about a portrait of the wind, from behind. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
